PythonRobotics
--------------
This project contains planning and control code adapted from PythonRobotics,
by Atsushi Sakai and other contributors:
https://github.com/AtsushiSakai/PythonRobotics

Upstream-attributed files include:
  CarlaBEV/src/planning/cubic_spline_planner.py
  CarlaBEV/src/planning/dijkstra.py
  CarlaBEV/src/control/stanley_controller.py

Related control utilities and state adaptations are covered by the same
retained attribution to the extent they incorporate PythonRobotics code.
CarlaBEV has modified the original algorithms and integration for its own
scene, geometry, control, and metric-state contracts.

The complete upstream MIT notice is in LICENSES/PythonRobotics-MIT.txt.
Existing author credits in source files are retained.

CARLA-derived Town01 assets
--------------------------
The maintainer created the bundled Town01 raster maps and graph files from
CARLA's Town01 environment. These are derived assets, not original CARLA
software source files. Their provenance and applicable upstream asset terms
are documented in CarlaBEV/assets/Town01/NOTICE.

